Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Dice: keyboard focus through a roll, reroll slip above
 the button, abilities named on the roll, one announcement per kept die

45.8 focus moves to Burn and reroll after a keyboard roll and to the result slip when the panel closes; Burn is 44px on touch. 45.9 the reroll slip opens above the line. 45.10 roll.abilities and the log line name the applied abilities. 60.5 the dice leave the tab order and the slip lines are the one control. Checked with test_ws_rolls.py (new test); browser checks follow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
